msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I can hear you just fine, my dear.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Now, what brings you all the way "
"up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……嗯，⟪k:4⟫听到了。⟪k:5⟫你怎么了，⟪k:6⟫竟然会特意来这里。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a3d23fcd646664db493f75731039e3984e3d4aea49977bb9539954ee16c760e
