msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sorry, Michel, but we are kindred spirits—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫as much as you may "
"want to deny it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫很遗憾，⟪k:3⟫米歇尔。⟪k:4⟫你和我是同一类人，⟪k:5⟫这是无可辩驳的。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8735c3176fa183e0e746d6f39bb3f25f149483625f26919eab54db56282aaeff
