msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am nothing like you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am a human... ⟪k:4⟫nothing more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我和你不一样。⟪k:2⟫我只是……⟪k:3⟫一个普通人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EF62B65E_16C7_4FCC_9043_63A39C0D7251
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a47e46f372ecb954d65cb277232f1d1e545fd82339bd707837aa6fb5808c8d35
