#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b95fc1af2ddce83f02ff2dafe7a9c257e73700870f1e8313cc7ee67caea7a17d
