msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Allow me to make a prediction before I depart, Michel,⟪k:3⟫cursed namesake of an "
"archangel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫米歇尔……⟪k:3⟫拥有天使之名却被诅咒之人啊。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫我对你做出最后的预言。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d61fd469a7d60ec1a6647e9f73f90e67e15bb0c889f3ce2f35fca243351d16f5
